%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1a9f4185281afaf46926db1a25a2822d, type: 3}
  m_Name: juyan-arrival-1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  description: 
  isBlocking: 1
  id: 1001
  dialogList:
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 40b8f547de70441429ab97ee87f24d28, type: 2}
    overrideName: ZhengJi
    overridePortrait: {fileID: 0}
    useBlackboardName: 0
    nameKey: 
    dialogText: Juyan... Back when the General of the Light Cavalry swept through
      Hexi, this place was a bastion of magnificence. Now, nothing remains but broken
      bricks and shattered tiles.
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 040104332c0706043997fff01846f372, type: 2}
    overrideName: ChangHui
    overridePortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8a72dbe276cf1e34bb4a7bd81cd2e9b9, type: 3}
    useBlackboardName: 0
    nameKey: 
    dialogText: General Zheng, sentimentality is a luxury we cannot afford. The threat
      of the Xiongnu Zhuri King is already at our doorstep. Our mission is to establish
      a foothold here and restore peace to the Western Regions once more.
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 40b8f547de70441429ab97ee87f24d28, type: 2}
    overrideName: ZhengJi
    overridePortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 74b572e97e778f846a1f3cdd95fc2056, type: 3}
    useBlackboardName: 0
    nameKey: 
    dialogText: You are right. The Imperial Court has placed its trust in us. By
      leading these garrison troops to hold this ground, we are mending the severed
      Silk Road. Every step we take forward is the reclamation of Han territory.
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 040104332c0706043997fff01846f372, type: 2}
    overrideName: ChangHui
    overridePortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8a72dbe276cf1e34bb4a7bd81cd2e9b9, type: 3}
    useBlackboardName: 0
    nameKey: 
    dialogText: Then let us begin beneath our very feet. To secure our stay in the
      Western Regions, we must rebuild Juyan from the ground up.
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 040104332c0706043997fff01846f372, type: 2}
    overrideName: ChangHui
    overridePortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8a72dbe276cf1e34bb4a7bd81cd2e9b9, type: 3}
    useBlackboardName: 0
    nameKey: 
    dialogText: General Zheng, our garrison troops are not mere travelers; they are
      the pioneers of what is to come. To reclaim these lost lands, our first priority
      in Juyan is to 'erect shelters'.
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 40b8f547de70441429ab97ee87f24d28, type: 2}
    overrideName: ZhengJi
    overridePortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 74b572e97e778f846a1f3cdd95fc2056, type: 3}
    useBlackboardName: 0
    nameKey: 
    dialogText: I understand. A city as great as Juyan cannot stand without a foundation.
      Only with quarters can our men find a true sense of belonging. This will no
      longer be a foreign land, but our stronghold.
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 040104332c0706043997fff01846f372, type: 2}
    overrideName: ChangHui
    overridePortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8a72dbe276cf1e34bb4a7bd81cd2e9b9, type: 3}
    useBlackboardName: 0
    nameKey: 
    dialogText: "Precisely. Houses are the cornerstone of all development. With a
      home to shield them from the wind and sand, these professional soldiers can
      focus on both farming and war. Only then will the displaced people realize
      that the Han has truly returned. General, give the order to begin construct
      HOUSE\u2014expand our population capacity."
